  "description": "The MonoGame 3.8.6.1 runtime for Windows on DirectX 11, with compute, tessellation and geometry shaders (cpt-max's fork), 128 shader resources a stage, 64 UAVs at feature level 11.1, buffers read back and GPU timestamps read without waiting, native interop, and resizable swap chain render targets. Its effects are MGFX 100, built by the matching compiler: a game's content by BorrowedTorch.MonoGame.Content.Builder.Compute and .Task.Compute, at the same version.",
